<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.35995.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.35995.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.35995, versus 1.35184 yesterday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
